===Interjection===
{{head|cic|interjection}}

# [[hello]]


Other forms of "hello" in the Chickasaw language are:

'''Chokma/Chukma''' (Most standard way of "hello" in the Chickasaw language)

'''Halito''' (Common among Chickasaws who live within the Choctaw Nation)

'''Mishiho''' (archaic form, now coming back into the Chickasaw language and referenced in the new Chickasaw dictionary)